/**
 * WeLease Pipeline — INGESTION JOBS  v1.0.0 · 2026-08-05
 * Requires Core_v2.gs. AppFolio only.
 *
 * Four staged jobs pull every endpoint the 26 tracked metrics need.
 * Staging exists to respect the 7-request/15-second rate limit and Apps Script's
 * 6-minute execution cap — not for tidiness.
 *
 *   02:00  rebuildAll         directories, PM groups, unit variance
 *   02:30  rebuildFinancials  rent roll, delinquency, unpaid charges
 *   03:00  rebuildLeasing     renewals, applications, vacancy, expirations
 *   03:30  rebuildCompliance  work orders, inspections, move-in/out events
 *   04:30  computeMetrics     (Metrics.gs)
 */

// ============================================================ COLUMN SETS

/**
 * AppFolio returns every column by default. work_order alone is 78 columns and
 * rental_applications is 85 — reading those back out of the sheet is what made the
 * dashboard take 38 seconds to render. We use roughly a third of them, so ask for
 * only those. Average reduction ~60% of cells.
 *
 * Every name below is verified against the live column data in the master JSON.
 * If a metric ever needs a new field, add it here FIRST or it will silently be null.
 */
